<body>
    <h1>Starting Methods for Apps</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>For all sessions that can be started by the user, a selection of=
 starting methods is provided.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Session name</strong>: Name for the session.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-war=
ning">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-inform=
ation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>The session name must not contain any of these characters: <code>\ / : *=
 ? =E2=80=9C &lt; &gt; | [ ] { } ( )</code></p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"StartingMethodsforApps-StartingMethodsforSession">Starting Method=
s for Session</h2>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Start menu</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session can be launched from the start menu.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Menu folder</strong></p>
<p>If you specify a folder name or a path comprising a number of folder nam=
es separated by "/", a menu path will be created for the session. The menu =
path will be used in the start menu and in the desktop context menu.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Start menu's system tab</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session can be launched with the start menu's system tab.<=
/p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Application Launcher</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91&nbsp;The session can be launched with the Application Launcher=
.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Application Launcher folder</strong></p>
<p>If you specify a folder name or a path comprising a number of folder nam=
es separated by "/", a menu path will be created for the session. The menu =
path will be used in the Application Launcher.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Desktop</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session can be launched with a program launcher on the des=
ktop.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Desktop folder</strong></p>
<p>If you specify a folder name or a path comprising a number of folder nam=
es separated by "/", a menu path will be created for the session. The menu =
path will be used for the program launcher on the desktop.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Desktop context menu</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session can be launched with the desktop context menu.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Quick start panel</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session can be launched with the quick start panel.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-=
4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">Password protection</span></strong></p>
<p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-4fcc-b6b=
a-60e0477a12b2">Specifies which password will be requested when launching t=
he session.</span></p>
<p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-4fcc-b6b=
a-60e0477a12b2">Possible values:</span></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-=
4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">None</span></strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-m=
arker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">: No password is r=
equested when launching the session.</span></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-=
4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">Administrator</span></strong><span class=3D"inline-=
comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">: The adm=
inistrator password is requested when launching the session.</span></p></li=
>
<li>
<p><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-=
4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">User</span></strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-m=
arker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">: The user passwor=
d is requested when launching the session.</span></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-=
4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">Setup user</span></strong><span class=3D"inline-com=
ment-marker" data-ref=3D"2a4e9377-00c5-4fcc-b6ba-60e0477a12b2">: The setup =
user password is requested when launching the session.</span></p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p><strong>Password protection</strong> only works if the selected<span cla=
ss=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3"> password is configured under </span><strong=
><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Security &gt; Password</span></str=
ong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">. Without the password configur=
ation, the session will launch without requesting a password. For more info=
rmation, see </span><a href=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/=
IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302358/Password+and+User+Types+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-l=
inked-resource-id=3D"73302358" data-linked-resource-version=3D"7" data-link=
ed-resource-type=3D"page">Password and User Types in IGEL OS 12</a><span cl=
ass=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"StartingMethodsforApps-HotkeyConfiguration">Hotkey Configuration<=
/h2>
<p><strong>Hotkey</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session can be started with a hotkey. A hotkey consists of=
 one or more <strong>modifiers</strong>&nbsp;and a&nbsp;<strong>key</strong=
>.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Modifiers</strong></p>
<p>A modifier or a combination of several modifiers for the hotkey. You can=
 select a set key symbol/combination or your own key symbol/combination. A =
key symbol is a defined chain of characters, e.g.&nbsp;<code>Ctrl</code>.</=
p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>Do not use [AltGr] as a modifier (represented as&nbsp;<code>Mod5</code>)=
. Otherwise, the key that is configured as a hotkey with AltGr cannot be us=
ed as a regular key anymore. Example: If you configure [AltGr] + [E] as a h=
otkey, it is impossible to enter an "e".</p>
</div>
</div>
<p>These are the pre-defined modifiers and the associated key symbols:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>(No modifier) =3D&nbsp;<code>None</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluenc=
e-embedded-image confluence-content-image-inline" alt=3D"image-20240716-130=
120.png" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"18aecb9cd8730d21d1b3dbd0ae33c70cb13c1e3a9e=
d8bb5f705114e5a510c875" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/w=
iki/download/attachments/73302709/image-20240716-130120.png?version=3D1&amp=
;modificationDate=3D1721134882005&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-h=
eight=3D"22" data-width=3D"20" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"121569439" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linke=
d-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-=
20240716-130120.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki"=
 data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-conta=
iner-id=3D"73302709" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-medi=
a-id=3D"b64b2b43-481e-4bed-af9c-ca392f06e9a0" data-media-type=3D"file" widt=
h=3D"20" height=3D"22"></span>&nbsp;=3D&nbsp;<code>Shift</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>[Ctrl] =3D&nbsp;<code>Ctrl</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluenc=
e-embedded-image confluence-content-image-inline" alt=3D"image-20240716-130=
102.png" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"4182ce1c7c753877e45698667b0876513dcce069a2=
47a46ee535c435b816c3fe" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/w=
iki/download/attachments/73302709/image-20240716-130102.png?version=3D1&amp=
;modificationDate=3D1721134863920&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-h=
eight=3D"16" data-width=3D"16" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"121536623" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linke=
d-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-=
20240716-130102.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki"=
 data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-conta=
iner-id=3D"73302709" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-medi=
a-id=3D"93b6e888-41ff-4ab5-8776-c8dbeef31b61" data-media-type=3D"file" widt=
h=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span>&nbsp;=3D&nbsp;<code>Mod4</code></p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>When this keyboard key is used as a modifier, it is represented as&nbsp;=
<code>Mod4</code>; when it is used as a key, it is represented as&nbsp;<cod=
e>Super_L</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>[Alt] =3D&nbsp;<code>Alt</code></p></li>
</ul>
<p>Key combinations are formed as follows with&nbsp;<code>|</code>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Ctrl + <span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"co=
nfluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-inline" alt=3D"image-20240=
716-130111.png" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"a6bf0e95ca882dbcd06f469fefb9b1bbccc=
31123fa1f4a27532a4daa189cffc1" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassia=
n.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302709/image-20240716-130111.png?version=
=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1721134872878&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2=
" data-height=3D"16" data-width=3D"16" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" =
data-linked-resource-id=3D"121569433" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" da=
ta-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=
=3D"image-20240716-130111.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian=
.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-reso=
urce-container-id=3D"73302709" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5"=
 data-media-id=3D"453f8ea2-3825-41c5-9a94-22fe69f96743" data-media-type=3D"=
file" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span> =3D&nbsp;<code>Ctrl|Super_L</code>=
</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Key</strong></p>
<p>Key for the hotkey</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>To enter a key that does not have a visible character, e.&nbsp;g. the [T=
ab] key, open a terminal, log on as&nbsp;<code>user</code>&nbsp;and enter&n=
bsp;<code>xev -event keyboard</code>. Press the key to be used for the hotk=
ey. The text in brackets that begins with&nbsp;<code>keysym</code>&nbsp;con=
tains the key symbol for the&nbsp;<strong>Key</strong>&nbsp;field. Example:=
&nbsp;<code>Tab</code>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<code>(keysym 0xff09, Tab)</code></p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"StartingMethodsforApps-AutostartConfiguration">Autostart Configur=
ation</h2>
<p><strong>Autostart</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session will be launched automatically when the device boo=
ts.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Restart</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The session will be relaunched automatically after the termina=
tion.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Autostart delay</strong></p>
<p>Waiting time in seconds between the complete startup of the desktop and =
the automatic session launch.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Autostart notification</strong></p>
<p>This parameter is available if&nbsp;<strong>Autostart</strong>&nbsp;is a=
ctivated and&nbsp;<strong>Autostart delay</strong>&nbsp;is set to a value g=
reater than zero.</p>
<p>=E2=98=91 For the duration defined by&nbsp;<strong>Autostart delay</stro=
ng>, a dialog is shown which allows the user to start the session immediate=
ly or cancel the automatic session start.</p>
<p>=E2=98=90&nbsp;No dialog is shown; the session is started automatically =
after the timespan specified with&nbsp;<strong>Autostart delay</strong>.</p=
>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Autostart requires network</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 If no network is available at system startup, the session is n=
ot started. A message is shown. As soon as the network is available, the se=
ssion is started automatically.</p>
<p>=E2=98=90 The session is started automatically, even when no network is =
available.</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
